OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod presents
OL,7,     Fanother selection of anonymous
OL,8,     Fmusic and asks: when a work's
OL,9,     Fcreator is unknown, who else comes
OL,10,     Fto the fore in its story? With
OL,11,     FLisa Colton and Fay Hield.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FCellist Geirthrudur Gudmundsdottir
OL,14,     Fperforms live. Tina Sinatra
OL,15,     F(producer), Kathleen Marshall
OL,16,     F(director & choreographer) & Joe
OL,17,     FDiPietro (writer) discuss Sinatra
OL,18,     Fthe Musical.
