OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,9,     FBach, Schubert and Percy Grainger.
OL,10,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     FLive from the Aldeburgh Festival,
OL,12,     Fthe Britten Sinfonia is joined by
OL,13,     Fmezzo-soprano Helen Charlston for
OL,14,     FBritten's dramatic cantata
OL,15,     FPhaedra, plus music by Stravinsky
OL,16,     Fand Woolrich.
OL,17,G2145 Between the Ears: Miniatures
OL,18,G     (Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,19,     FHolly Thomas takes us with her on
OL,20,     Fa walk through twilight. As the
OL,21,     Flight shifts, so does our
OL,22,     Fperspective.
